3,"Paper Presentation: ""Music Fiddling in an Indigenous Q'anjob'al M...",https://archive.org/details/calauem_200201_omvf0000183,"Juan is of Q'anjob'al Maya descent from Guatemala, a first-generation student, and an avid marimbist. As a researcher, he focuses on the Maya people's music traditions in Guatemala, particularly the indigenous fiddle and marimba performances in Q'anjob'al Maya religious customs...",Q’anjob’al,Mayan
4,The Mayan Marimba and the Musical Production of Place in...,https://escholarship.org/uc/item/8gw3s21m,"In my first meeting with the Maya Q'anjob'al community in Los Angeles, I gained two important insights into their existence in LA: first, they were here because they had been displaced from their land by a violent civil war in which non-Indigenous Guatemalans targeted Mayan populations.",Q’anjob’al,Mayan
