6,A Quick Primer On Q'anjob'al And Other Mayan Languages | WLRN,https://www.wlrn.org/news/2019-09-10/a-quick-primer-on-qanjobal-and-other-mayan-languages,"Q’anjob’al and other Mayan languages are separate languages, not dialects. Shosted, the professor, pointed out that the “language” label is often a reflection of power — as one adage says, “a language is a dialect with an army and a navy”...",Q’anjob’al,Mayan
